<title>GERMANY: EU grain area for 1997 harvest seen 3-4 pct higher.</title>
<headline>EU grain area for 1997 harvest seen 3-4 pct higher.</headline>
<dateline>HAMBURG 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union grain area for the 1997 harvest has been expanded by three to four percent from 1996 to 37.5-38 million hectares, grain trader Alfred Toepfer's monthly newsletter said.</p>
<p>The newsletter did not make a production forecast. The 1996 crop amounted to 202 million tonnes.</p>
<p>-Hamburg newsroom, +49-40-41903275</p>
</text>
